<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify">Portions of this registrant&#8217;s definitive proxy
statement for its 2026 Annual Meeting of Stockholders to be filed with the SEC no later than 120 days after the end of the registrant&#8217;s
fiscal year are incorporated herein by reference in Part III of this Annual Report on Form 10-K.</p>

