</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8AD_zqd69nK34BTh" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">These warrants were issued in
conjunction with an underwritten public equity offering, therefore, there was no employee or non-employee compensation expense recognized.
In November 2024, the underwriter elected to exercise all <span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisedInPeriodShares_c20241101__20241130__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_zSgWqI3s3N7f" title="Warrants exercised"><ix:nonFraction name="NEOV:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisedInPeriodShares" contextRef="From2024-11-012024-11-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" id="Fact000812" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">58,500</ix:nonFraction></span> Warrants at an exercise price of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1_iI_c20241130__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_zEldlwd4OTN5" title="Warrants, exercise price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" id="Fact000814" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">4.40</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, via a cashless exercise,
as permitted under the warrant agreement, resulting in the issuance of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight_iI_c20241130__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_z2496SxFYC8k" title="Common shares issued"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" id="Fact000816" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">15,312</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of our common stock. Additionally, the holders of
publicly issued Warrants to purchase an aggregate of <span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights_iI_c20241130__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_zvshwAhfrGn6" title="Warrants to purchase shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" contextRef="AsOf2024-11-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" id="Fact000818" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">40,100</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of our common stock elected to exercise their Warrants by a cash payment
of a total of $<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ProceedsFromWarrantExercises_c20241101__20241130__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--WarrantMember_z8cp8vDJ9Ne2" title="Cash proceeds"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ProceedsFromWarrantExercises" contextRef="From2024-11-012024-11-30_us-gaap_WarrantMember" id="Fact000820" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">160,400</ix:nonFraction></span> resulting in the issuance of the underlying shares of our common stock in December 2024.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><i>Stock Compensation Expense</i>
&#8211; Under our shareholder-approved 2019 Stock Option Plan, we make awards of Restricted Stock Units (&#8220;RSUs&#8221;), Non-Qualified
Stock Options, and direct grants of Common Stock to our officers, employees, directors, and various consultants, as further described
below.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">In the year ended June 30, 2026,
we made our initial issuance of <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zdArhaiQlD34" title="Grants in period, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000822" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">174,000</ix:nonFraction></span> Non-Qualified Stock Options to a group of non-executive employees to purchase shares of common
stock at the then-current stock price in the range of $<span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zjOMLREfn8z8" title="Share price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000824" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.04</ix:nonFraction></span> -<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zwYYcqTBMkAl" title="Share price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000826" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.60</ix:nonFraction></span> per share. These options are exercisable for a period of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2_dtY_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zUGXiXt9YkF4" title="Exercisable for period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000828" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2">5</ix:nonNumeric></span> years from
the date of issuance and will become vested on a ratable basis over a period of <span id="xdx_908_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1_dtY_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zTEwkXCNXetf" title="Vested for period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000830" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1">3</ix:nonNumeric></span> years from the date of issuance. Using the Black-Scholes
valuation model, and assuming expected volatility in the range of <span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_dp_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zYdwYXIrXbV" title="Assuming expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000832" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">78.6</ix:nonFraction></span>-<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_dp_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_z9RyM96u3pLl" title="Assuming expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000834" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">81.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% and current interest rate in the range of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MinimumMember_zCkYpSC24smg" title="Current interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MinimumMember" id="Fact000836" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.1</ix:nonFraction></span>-<span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--RangeAxis__srt--MaximumMember_zKMwaJd9BdL8" title="Current interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_srt_MaximumMember" id="Fact000838" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.3</ix:nonFraction></span>%, we calculated
that the total fair value of these options at issuance was approximately $<span id="xdx_901_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zSQ38h5Nsny8" title="Grant date fair value"><ix:nonFraction name="NEOV:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue" contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000840" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">406,000</ix:nonFraction></span> and are amortizing this total amount to stock compensation
expense, as adjusted for forfeitures, on a straight-line basis over the <span id="xdx_905_ecustom--SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm_dtY_c20250701__20260630__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zPEIs8Xn4Y83" title="Straight-line basis over period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-012026-06-30_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000842" name="NEOV:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm">3</ix:nonNumeric></span>-year vesting period of the options.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">On February 23, 2026, we issued
Non-Qualified Stock Options to two executive employees to purchase a value equivalent total of <span id="xdx_90E_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross_c20260222__20260223__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zs6gSpQ8pizl" title="Grants in period, shares"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodGross" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" id="Fact000844" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">2,232,697</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of common stock at the
current stock price of $<span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--SharePrice_iI_c20260630__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zj6mkDUGtR36" title="Share price"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:SharePrice" contextRef="AsOf2026-06-30_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" id="Fact000846" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="USDPShares">3.54</ix:nonFraction></span> per share, in exchange for surrender of their right to receive a total of <span id="xdx_90F_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsForfeituresInPeriod_c20260222__20260223__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zuoKT41VE8ti" title="Surrendered RSUs"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsForfeituresInPeriod" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" id="Fact000848" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">1,520,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of previously-issued
RSUs, which will vest at the rate of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20260222__20260223__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__us-gaap--RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember_zeDYWk49h0A3" title="Risk-free interest"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_us-gaap_RestrictedStockUnitsRSUMember" id="Fact000850" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">25</ix:nonFraction></span>% per year for <span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1_dtY_c20260222__20260223__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zo4MGC6qIGik" title="Option vesting period"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" format="ixt-sec:duryear" id="Fact000852" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1">4</ix:nonNumeric></span> years, subject to their continued service to the Company on each vesting date,
with no incremental cost arising. Using the Black-Scholes valuation model, and assuming expected volatility of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate_dp_c20260222__20260223__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zt3VqOLJYxBc" title="Assuming expected volatility"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsExpectedVolatilityRate" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000854" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">81.5</ix:nonFraction></span>% and current interest
rate of <span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate_dp_c20260222__20260223__srt--TitleOfIndividualAxis__srt--ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_zYmMgtq8Pruj" title="Current interest rate"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardFairValueAssumptionsRiskFreeInterestRate" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_srt_ChiefExecutiveOfficerMember_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember" id="Fact000856" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" scale="-2" unitRef="Pure">4.1</ix:nonFraction></span>%, we calculated that the total fair value of these options at issuance was approximately $<span id="xdx_90A_ecustom--ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue_c20260222__20260223__us-gaap--AwardTypeAxis__custom--NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember__srt--CounterpartyNameAxis__custom--TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember_zcf4GipbtoQd" title="Grants in period, value"><ix:nonFraction name="NEOV:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOptionsGrantsInPeriodValue" contextRef="From2026-02-222026-02-23_custom_NonQualifiedStockOptionsMember_custom_TwoExecutiveEmployeesMember" id="Fact000858" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">5,380,800</ix:nonFraction></span> and the remaining unrecognized
compensation cost of the surrendered RSUs is being expensed on a straight-line basis over the 4-year vesting period of the options.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<ix:exclude><p id="xdx_234_zoHZGh7sZitd" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p></ix:exclude>

