</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001020" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock"><p id="xdx_801_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock_zNqAthxK1Oma" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"></p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><tr style="vertical-align: top">
<td style="width: 0"/><td style="width: 0.5in"><b>(6)</b></td><td><b><span id="xdx_827_z6UJuBq3TEI4">Income Taxes</span> </b></td></tr></table>
<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>



<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify"><b></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">The Company is subject to United
States federal income taxes at an approximate rate of 21%. The Company has no taxable income or taxable losses sourced from any foreign
operations. The reconciliation of the provision for income taxes at the federal statutory rate, compared to the Company&#8217;s income
tax expense as reported, is as follows (rounded to the nearest $00):</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify"></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0 0 0pt; text-align: justify"></p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-07-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact001022" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfComponentsOfIncomeTaxExpenseBenefitTableTextBlock"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="xdx_899_eus-gaap--ScheduleOfComponentsOfIncomeTaxExpenseBenefitTableTextBlock_z0AIbnTSdGTb" summary="xdx: Disclosure - Income Taxes (Details - Schedule of income tax expense)" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%">
  <tr style="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: White">
